From the repository root with Java 21 on PATH:

```powershell
New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force .learning-work/splitwise-classes | Out-Null
javac -encoding UTF-8 -d .learning-work/splitwise-classes examples/learning-java/src/kb/splitwise/*.java
java -ea -cp .learning-work/splitwise-classes kb.splitwise.SplitChecks
